message: "If you use this template, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Minimal Reveal.js Research Template"
abstract: >-
  A Reveal.js template for research talks that builds to a single
  self-contained HTML file, with build-time LaTeX math (MathJax), BibTeX
  citations, a chapter-aware table of contents and syntax highlighting.
